  "resolution_html": "<p>As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the <strong>Report Phishing</strong> ribbon. See below illustrations</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-3-45-18-PM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder</strong></p>",
